## Custom Icon

### Show code
<DsTag
  label="Custom Icon Tag"
  onClick={() => {}}
  slots={{
    icon: <DsIcon icon="star" size="tiny"/>
  }}
  variant="include"
/>

### MCP manifest
const CustomIcon = () => <DsTag
    label="Custom Icon Tag"
    variant="include"
    slots={{
        icon: <DsIcon icon="star" size="tiny" />,
    }} />;